Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Song,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 6,0:00:12.96,0:00:20.19,Song,,0,0,0,,{「星空のエトランゼ」by Mami Yamase; full lyrics found: 聞こえるメロディ\N恋人たちのシンフォニー\Nさびしくないよね\N守ってあげる　僕が\N\Nどこか知らない星から来たの\N君をはなさないよ\N瞳が光る\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N帰れないシルエット\N迷（まよ）い子のネコなら\N両手ひろげ　あたためて\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N泣かないでシルエット\N夢だけあればいい\N恋人が待っている　きっと…\N\Nサヨナラ　あしたも\Nいつものように　ここで\N傷つけあったら\N涙をふいておいで\N\N人はみんな旅をしているよ\Nだからここにいてね\N愛するために\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N抱きしめてメモリアル\N星に降る雨さえ\Nキラキラときらめくよ\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N約束のメモリアル\N君さえいればもう\N幸せが続くよね　ずっと…\N\Nどこか知らない星から来たの\N君をはなさないよ\N瞳が光る\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N帰れないシルエット\N迷（まよ）い子のネコなら\N両手ひろげ　あたためて\N\N星空のエトランゼ\N泣かないでシルエット\N夢だけあればいい\N恋人が待っている\N\N恋人が待っている\Nキラキラと輝くよ　きっと…} I can hear the melody,\Nthe lovers' symphony
Dialogue: 6,0:00:20.19,0:00:27.93,Song,,0,0,0,,You won't be lonely,\NI'll protect you
Dialogue: 6,0:00:28.43,0:00:42.31,Song,,0,0,0,,Did you come from some unknown planet?\NI won't let you go as long as your eyes shine
Dialogue: 6,0:00:43.31,0:00:46.70,Song,,0,0,0,,A stranger in the starry sky {étranger}
Dialogue: 6,0:00:46.70,0:00:50.30,Song,,0,0,0,,A silhouette that can't go home
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.23,0:00:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you like it too? \NVery well, come here.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.35,0:00:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{Father, you're rewatching this tape \Nfor the third time already.} {actually "grandpa" but I assume in this family he is the grandpa, this lady is mother, and the girl in the chair is granddaughter} Dad, this is already the third \Ntime you've rewatched this tape.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.64,0:00:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say. Good stuff is good\N no matter how many times you watch it.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.34,0:00:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wouldn't you agree, little one?} Don't you think so, little guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.21,0:00:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.81,0:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kayoko! Can't you tell him to be quiet? {I assume kayoko is the granddaughter or something, it's not clear who he's talking to in this shot}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.02,0:00:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.67,0:00:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.42,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad dog, Shinnosuke.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.62,0:00:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize our usual postman?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.17,0:01:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, are you hungry?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.11,0:01:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm almost done here, \Nso wait just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.57,0:01:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing? \NAre you crazy or something, Shinnosuke?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.79,0:01:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.23,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've come to check on our Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.20,0:01:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Is that any way to treat our visitors?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.40,0:01:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you ever learn?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.55,0:01:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bark at people indiscriminately!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.36,0:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, cheer up, Shinnosuke.\NJust don't bark so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.48,0:01:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.58,0:01:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was scary!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.56,0:01:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, about Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.44,0:02:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, didn't I tell you \Nto stop bothering people? {/get in the way - referring to michael getting in front of the TV and such}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.29,0:02:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's nothing. \NMichael is really cute, after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.39,0:02:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to Michael, our Shinnosuke,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:09.76,0:02:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,who keeps barking at whoever it may be, \Nis the real troublemaker.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.57,0:02:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Michael, say thank you \Nto Grandma and Grandpa. Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:19.81,0:02:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how cute! Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:41.50,0:02:44.00,Thought,,0,0,0,,Don't bark at people indiscriminately!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.35,0:02:47.25,Thought,,0,0,0,,Oh! Aren't you cute, Michael?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:57.66,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.80,0:03:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what happened at Kayoko's place?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.55,0:03:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.57,0:03:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows, maybe they were in danger.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:22.50,0:03:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary stuff!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.54,0:03:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how nobody noticed a thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.71,0:03:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good grief, Shinnosuke! \NWhat the hell were you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.48,0:03:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogs can't slack off at work! \NWhat a useless mutt!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.66,0:03:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,A burglar broke into Kayoko's house\Nwhile the dog was there.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.02,0:03:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A burglar broke in, \Neven with the dog there?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.18,0:03:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? So even a dog didn't stop him?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.64,0:04:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, Shinnosuke is hopelessly dense.\N Get it together!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.88,0:04:09.55,Thought,,0,0,0,,Michael, you jerk. \NOne day, I'll show you your place! {??? itsuka kitto?}
Comment: 0,0:04:11.43,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.32,0:04:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, you {\i1}must{\i0} hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.02,0:04:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't finish it by morning, \Nit'll be the end of us both!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.53,0:04:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.66,0:05:00.10,Narrator,,0,0,0,,At 2 AM, the Kobayashi apartment \Nturned into a battlefield.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.40,0:05:07.47,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, Michael is sleeping soundly in the next room.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.47,0:05:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's right. We'll send you two more pages by morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:10.71,0:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give my regards to the print shop. Thanks.{It's "print shop", not "printing shop"}
Comment: 10,0:05:12.98,0:05:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{just a noise}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:14.75,0:05:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got the rest covered. {the rest of the job - printing etc}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.75,0:05:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll catch a nap \Nuntil the manuscript is finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:49.25,0:05:51.60,Narrator,,0,0,0,,6 AM: Michael wakes up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.89,0:05:58.38,Narrator,,0,0,0,,He starts his day with light exercise.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.76,0:06:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, Michael, you're so loud \Nearly in the morning!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.10,0:06:08.67,Narrator,,0,0,0,,06:05: Mom wakes up \Nto Michael's intense stomping. {actually "wife" but she's only Kobayashi's wife, so narrator uses that as her role in the family. idk what to call her}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.67,0:06:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Michael, a delicious snack.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.54,0:06:14.84,Narrator,,0,0,0,,06:20: Michael's breakfast.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.45,0:06:20.15,Narrator,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.45,Narrator,,0,0,0,,06:25: Straining himself. {to strain or exert oneself; to go all out}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.42,0:06:29.22,Narrator,,0,0,0,,06:35: Feeling refreshed, \NMichael goes back to sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.38,0:06:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, you're in the way! \NGo away for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.51,0:06:47.11,Narrator,,0,0,0,,08:10: Drinking water.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.74,0:06:51.78,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Michael is startled.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.70,Narrator,,0,0,0,,08:13: Back to sleep again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.83,0:07:07.46,Narrator,,0,0,0,,10:23: He wakes up.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And back to sleep again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.42,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.21,0:07:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,We've still got two pages left! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, what were you doing?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please wake up, Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.84,0:07:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Did you send the manuscript? {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.18,0:07:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.95,0:07:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll shake them up and make them finish it somehow! With a whip if I have to!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.72,0:07:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, the print shop has agreed to wait longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.93,0:07:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Please get back to the manuscript \Nas soon as you finish eating!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.53,0:07:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that clear?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.33,0:07:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Immediately?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.23,0:07:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Isono-san, didn't you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.90,0:07:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband can't think straight \Nfor at least three hours after eating.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.87,0:07:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sensei, you can't do that to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:56.23,0:07:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.81,Narrator,,0,0,0,,At 10:45, Michael can't help \Nbut run away from the apartment.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.69,Narrator,,0,0,0,,1 PM: Nap time.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.69,0:08:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg of you, please wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.63,0:08:17.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Dad is also napping. {husband}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.04,0:08:32.13,Narrator,,0,0,0,,01:17: Michael suddenly awakens to love and is smitten. {??? idk what's that last iya bakkan bit, I'm guessing it's something like "oh no, I'm speechless"}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.78,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Really, are you stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.40,0:08:56.74,Narrator,,0,0,0,,01:19: Michael is in tears \Nfrom the pain of heartbreak.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.22,0:09:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sensei, Sensei... please wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.22,0:09:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Three hours have long since passed, Sensei!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:04.96,0:09:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, you idiot! I said, wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.42,0:09:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, oh, whatever shall we do?! {https://www.japandict.com/%E5%81%89%E3%81%84%E3%81%93%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83 }
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.73,0:09:28.77,Narrator,,0,0,0,,10 PM: Michael, who had been sleeping
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.44,Narrator,,0,0,0,,since afternoon trying to get over his unfortunate love,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.44,0:09:34.16,Narrator,,0,0,0,,finally wakes up, with his energy restored.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.44,0:09:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe go out now?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.92,0:09:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...is what I would've done, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.03,0:09:55.50,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Since his owner is sleeping, \NMichael sleeps with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.50,0:09:58.80,Narrator,,0,0,0,,This is how cats sleep all day long.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.80,0:10:00.75,Narrator,,0,0,0,,In contrast, manga artists...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.27,0:10:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh. I don't have any time \Nto sleep at all here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.77,0:10:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie! You sleep even more than a cat does!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.68,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to work!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.48,Narrator,,0,0,0,,These excruciating, painful events
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.48,0:10:17.88,Narrator,,0,0,0,,are repeated 365 days a year in the Kobayashi household.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.19,0:10:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night...
Comment: 0,0:10:20.60,0:10:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.16,0:10:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1, and... start!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.63,0:10:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, everyone! \NThis is Hojo Shino reporting for duty. {Hojo Shino the reporter.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.40,0:10:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}Cat Visit{\i0}, {program name}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.14,0:10:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,where we introduce the cute cats\N celebrities keep at their homes!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.54,0:10:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, we're going to the home
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.48,0:10:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,of Asaokayama Yukijiko-san, an actress\N who's unrivaled in popularity and beauty. {comedically long and elaborate name, almost a tongue twister, parody of https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yukiji_Asaoka}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.47,0:10:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.59,0:10:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for you. Come on in.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.23,0:11:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, is this the room \Nof our idol, Yukijiko-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.33,0:11:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lovely.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.46,0:11:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all. Now please, have a seat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.28,0:11:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So, without further ado, \Nwe'd like to see the cat.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, absolutely.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.40,0:11:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine? Catherine, come here! {katarin}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.31,0:11:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected, even the cat's name is noble. {lit: different [from normal people]}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.51,0:11:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No simple "Luna" or "Kitty."\N It's "Catherine"! {lit: no ball or bear - I guess typical cat names?}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.81,0:11:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like she's not coming, \Nso I'll bring her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.62,0:11:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, please.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.39,0:11:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Catherine? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.02,0:11:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, Catherine, \Nso you were sleeping up there?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.39,0:11:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We have visitors here to see you, \Nso let's say hello!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.35,0:11:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, here she comes!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.30,0:11:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The cat owned by actress Yukijiko-san, \Nthe ideal of beauty! {number one beautiful }
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.94,0:11:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She must be gorgeous, just like her owner!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.50,0:11:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for waiting!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.37,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's Catherine-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.11,0:11:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do I call that...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.55,0:11:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What breed of cat is that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.05,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a type called Catzilla. {nyajira}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.59,0:12:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,C-Catzilla? Is that a breed of cat?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.67,0:12:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and they're a very clever breed. \NActually, my Catherine can dance.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is that true?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's a natural at it.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.46,0:12:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you please show us?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.96,0:12:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Comment: 10,0:12:13.06,0:12:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.07,0:12:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There! {typical enka chant}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.14,0:12:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than "dancing," that looked like she's being "danced." Are you sure? {??? think she means "not dancing, being made to dance" but could be wrong, maybe some pun on "being manipulated"; also not sure what that ii desu ne means}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.04,0:12:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{Also, my Catherine knows\N the "wait" command!} {making a person, pet, etc. wait (before being permitted to do something)} Also, my Catherine listens \N when I tell her to "stay."
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.48,0:12:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? As expected, \Nshe must be very disciplined.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:32.85,0:12:33.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{Wait!} {don't touch it} Stay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.99,0:12:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{Y-Yeah...}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.67,0:12:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, goodness...!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.37,0:12:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,W-We'll see you next week!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.48,0:13:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Woof's that? {was: What the; changed for wanja, where 'wan' is Japanese for woof or bark}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.49,0:13:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, here's your food!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.96,0:13:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no time to lose! {/I'm busy}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.17,0:14:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, Michael, you've eaten it all already?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.64,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear! What were you thinking, \Nleaving the fridge wide open?!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.55,0:14:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? That wasn't me. {I don't know anything about it}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.18,0:14:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who did it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.88,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.51,0:14:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this cat?! {??? *** nani wo}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.79,0:14:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.54,0:14:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.51,0:15:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were the one who opened \N the fridge and ate Michael's food?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.20,0:15:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You stupid cat! \NWho ever let you in, anyway?! Get out! {lit: you entered another's house without permission}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.51,0:15:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{shoo}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.84,0:15:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I can't stand that shameless attitude!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.56,0:15:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one hell of a cat, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.92,0:15:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea there was one\N like that in our neighborhood.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.42,0:15:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did it come from? {whose cat is it}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.79,0:15:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me. I wonder if Michael knows.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.52,0:15:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael? Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange, I wonder where he went.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.44,0:15:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael?
Comment: 10,0:15:28.73,0:15:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{nyan}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.56,0:15:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not "meow!"
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.30,0:15:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were there, \Nwhy didn't you kick her out? {unsure if they know the cat's sex yet}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.77,0:15:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why she was able to eat up {\i1}your{\i0} meal!
Comment: 10,0:15:36.00,0:15:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{nyan}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No laughing it off for you! {lit: you won't trick us by laughing anymore}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.81,0:15:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{nyan}
Comment: 10,0:15:58.60,0:15:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{chapter}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.83,0:16:07.00,Narrator,,0,0,0,,A city that never sleeps. {?? lit: big city that blinks an eye }
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.00,0:16:12.64,Narrator,,0,0,0,,It offers a weary man \Na moment's respite from worries.
Comment: 10,0:16:23.08,0:16:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah....
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.22,0:16:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want no pickled vegetables. \NI want some dried sardines! {?? probably https://www.justonecookbook.com/shibazuke-pickles/ but seems kinda unconnected to sardines }
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.42,0:16:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I smell dried sardines!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.68,0:16:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it so early in the morning?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.55,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Open up, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.82,0:16:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I'll open it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.89,0:17:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael-kun, won't you come with us to the station?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.96,0:17:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop stalling and confess, boy! {from manga}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.23,0:17:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you stole those sardines from Monroe's over on third! {street}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.40,0:17:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play innocent by washing your face!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:13.83,0:17:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got a witness who saw you peeping into Monroe's apartment at that time.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.49,0:17:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Feigning innocence is pointless!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.46,0:17:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You point your ears my way when I'm talkin' to you, boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.66,0:17:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine! You say you didn't do it, \Nbut take a look at this!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.52,0:17:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,These are paw prints taken\N at the scene of the crime!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.42,0:17:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They match yours perfectly!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you underestimate the police!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.62,0:17:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't know. \NAll cat paw prints are the same, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.80,0:17:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! That distressed reaction \Nis all the proof I need! {shock/surprise}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.40,0:17:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What do you mean? \NWhich part of me says "distressed" to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.14,0:17:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, how about your tail?!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.77,0:18:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come clean and confess already! \NI can see right through you! {?? lit: the proof is broken}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The last time you pooped, you didn't cover it with sand! Too much trouble, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it all!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:33.53,0:18:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to deflect it \Nby washing your face!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see your tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.09,0:18:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Comment: 10,0:18:43.82,0:18:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.96,0:18:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! We're talking about \Nthe sardines incident right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.59,0:18:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's all right not to cover it up, then, huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.17,0:18:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, we're just wasting our time here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.06,0:18:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The evidence is all there. \NLet's send him to court.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.54,0:18:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.97,0:19:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! The court summons \Nthe prosecution's witness.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.81,0:19:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,On Meowary Meownd, around 10 PM, {nyan gatsu nyan nichi - literally "month meow day meow"}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:07.38,0:19:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you saw someone in Apartment Block 12 \Npeeping into Monroe's room, correct?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:11.59,0:19:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:12.59,0:19:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that man in this courtroom?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.39,0:19:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.52,0:19:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And who is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.23,0:19:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that man.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.16,0:19:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.93,0:19:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! The defense may now cross-examine the witness.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.33,0:19:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a question, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.90,0:19:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The witness is positive that the cat he saw \Nwas Michael, and saw his face?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.17,0:19:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes... I mean, I only saw him from behind,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.31,0:19:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,but those stripes can only belong to Michael.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.38,0:19:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So you say you recognized Michael \Njust by the stripes on his back?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.85,0:19:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please come in, everyone.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.39,0:19:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Michael, turn around.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, if you only look \Nat the stripes on their backs,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.36,0:19:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,cats of the same breed may look \Nas alike as two peas in a pod.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.97,0:20:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, the testimony \Nof the witness cannot be trusted.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.04,0:20:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.41,0:20:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now please clarify.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.17,0:20:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see {\i1}Michael{\i0} \Nsteal the dried sardines?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:11.21,0:20:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One cat's entire life \Ndepends on your testimony!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.02,0:20:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say for sure if it was Michael...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.75,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Presiding judge, as demonstrated earlier,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.62,0:20:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no solid evidence \Nthat Michael committed this crime.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.24,0:20:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will judge this case justly. {make the right ruling}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.91,0:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There's your solid proof! {??? *** shoukou wo}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.00,0:20:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Only you have this habit \Nof leaving the head behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.79,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No point hiding it, Michael!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.04,0:21:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what'll become of this.
